    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rieet Dee-bid tin jɔak",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti̱ti̱ täämɛ kɛ rieet Dee-bid tin jɔak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nɛɛ Dee-bid tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti̱ti̱ kɛ cio̱o̱t nɛɛni Dee-bid tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m. Yo-ceb-bɛ̈-cɛ-bɛth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yo-ceb-bɛ̈-cɛ-bɛth.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kɛ tha̱a̱ŋ gua̱thni dëë cɔl i̱ Ic-bo-cɛth. Kuɛnɛ kä cio̱o̱k kä.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " raan Tɛ̈-kɛ-mon. Ɛ bo̱o̱th nɛɛni diɔ̱k. Cuɛ nyiëëny kɛ nɛy ti kur bädäk kɛ mutdɛ kä cuɛ kɛ näk ɛn guäth ɛmɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ram in guur jɛ kä kɛn nɛy da̱ŋ diɔ̱k tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m a Ɛl-a-dhar gat Do-day, kä kuäy Ä-ɣo-ɣi, tëë kɛɛl kɛ Dee-bid mëë dɛ̈p ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt tëë ca rɔ̱ dol kɛ ko̱r, kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ̱ bar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ rɔ jiɛc kä cuɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt näk amäni mëë cuɛ tetdɛ luaŋ, cu tetdɛ dɔp puɔ̱ɔ̱ny muɔ̱t. Kä cu Kuoth Nhial naath jak kä juɔckɛ mɔ. Kä cu naath ɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛ ɣöö bikɛ pɛɛc.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ram min guur jɛ a Cama, gat Age raan Ɣa-rar. Kä ci ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt rɔ̱ mat kä Lɛ-i, rɛy ŋɔa̱a̱ri. Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ̱ bar kɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ cuɔ̱ŋ däär kakä gaŋɛ jɛ, kä cuɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt näk. Kä cu Kuoth Nhial naath jak kä juɔckɛ kɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ mëë ci gua̱th ŋër thia̱k, kä cu nɛy da̱ŋ diɔ̱k kä bööth ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k wä kä Dee-bid rɛy kɔ̱kä kä Ä-du-lam, kä ci bua̱n ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt pua̱t rɛy lo̱o̱lä ji̱ Rɛpa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wa̱nɔ te Dee-bid rɛy pa̱a̱m. Kä te buɔ̱n ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt kä Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid pi̱ go̱r wëë i̱, “Aɣ duŋ malɛ tekɛ ram mi no̱ŋä pi̱ ti dëë math rɛy jiɛw in te thok wec kä Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu wutni ti bum da̱ŋ diɔ̱k rɛt ni wec ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt, kä cukɛ pi̱ wä jɔm rɛy jiɛw thok wec kä Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm. Kä cukɛ kɛ nöŋ Dee-bid. Duundɛ ɣöö /kenɛ maath thi̱n. Cuɛ kɛ muɔc piny kämɛ kɛ Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “A jɛ na̱n kɛ ɣä lö Kuoth Nhial, kɛ ɣöö dëë pi̱ ti̱ti̱ math. Ɛ dëë riɛm nɛɛni ti ci tëkdiɛn thöp ti ku math?” Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ /kenɛ kɛ math. Cua tɔ̱tɔ̱ la̱t ɛ wutni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu Ä-bi-cay däman Yo-ab gat Dhɛ-ru-yaa a bo̱o̱th nɛɛni ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "diɔ̱k.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kä tha̱a̱ŋ buɔkni thuɔk Ɣi-bɛ-ru kɛ diɔ̱k.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Cuɛ nyiëëny kɛ nɛy ti kur diɔ̱k kɛ mutdɛ, kä cuɛ kɛ näk, kä cuɛ tekɛ kɛ̈k ce̱tkɛ nɛy da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu jɔɔc ni kɛ̈kdɛ ɛlɔ̱ŋ kä nɛy da̱ŋ diɔ̱k, kä cua bo̱o̱thdiɛn. Duundɛ ɣöö /kenɛ la ram kɛl kä kɛn nɛy da̱ŋ diɔ̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bɛ-na-yaa gat Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da a wääth ko̱o̱r kä Kɛ̈b-dhel, cuɛ nyin wääthä la̱t. Cuɛ wutni ko̱o̱r Mo-ab da̱ŋ rɛw näk, kä cuɛ lony lɛ wä näk rɛy waŋ ka cäŋ nhial guiiyni mi cäät naath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ raan rööl I-jëp näk, wut mi gɔaa. Kä ɛn raan I-jëp tëë kɛ mut duundɛ ɣöö cu Bɛ-na-yaa wä kä jɛ kɛ kɛɛt, kä cuɛ mut mac tetdä ran I-jëp, kä cuɛ jɛ näk kɛ mutdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tɔ̱tɔ̱ cua kɛ la̱t ɛ Bɛ-na-yaa gat Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da, ka cuɛ tekɛ kɛ̈k ce̱tkɛ wutni ko̱o̱r da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu te ni jɛn kɛ kɛ̈k rɛy nɛɛni ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k, duundɛ ɣöö /kenɛ a ram kɛl kä nɛy da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. Kä cu Dee-bid ɛ jak kä bo̱o̱th yiëënikɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛn diaal a nɛy ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ bärɔw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
